{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This Demo allows you to play the initial dungeons for the first wizard, training grounds, and daily &amp; player challenges (including watching other player's replays).</strong></i>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023520/extras/fb78a0c405ddc87814a64c53795ead40.poster.avif?t=1758836972\" width=854 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023520/extras/fb78a0c405ddc87814a64c53795ead40.webm?t=1758836972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023520/extras/fb78a0c405ddc87814a64c53795ead40.mp4?t=1758836972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Emperor wants gold, and you're just the wizard to get it. Journey into the depths with a Rook, an Archer, and maybe a spell or two. Upgrade your party, learn new skills yourself, and discover what\u2019s <i>really</i> going on in the darkness below. Spend the gold you find to help you survive - or risk saving it for the Emperor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chess meets Awesome</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023520/extras/bb9cb74436f9a5aaeac0769b2fc85962.poster.avif?t=1758836972\" width=854 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023520/extras/bb9cb74436f9a5aaeac0769b2fc85962.webm?t=1758836972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023520/extras/bb9cb74436f9a5aaeac0769b2fc85962.mp4?t=1758836972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No memorizing openings, long drawn-out endgames, or stalemates. Start with 1 piece instead of 16. Cast new pieces with exciting abilities onto the board. No analysis paralysis \u2013 enemy movement stays basic until you encounter the dungeon\u2019s bosses\u2026 Collect Undo Tokens if you need \u2019em, or more gold if you don\u2019t!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are not Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023520/extras/a505cd8b95f3ed81f7c6d841b18c9ef6.avif?t=1758836972\" width=1560 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post your epic victories as challenges to the community! Watch replays from top players to further improve your skills as you take on Daily Challenges. Dive into the custom board editor (full version only - not in demo) to create &amp; download new rooms to spice up your dungeons in this massively single-player experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a Test</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023520/extras/27a03ac024a7479d24fd28569dfc0ae8.avif?t=1758836972\" width=1560 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer simple questions based on your psychological state and relationships to your pieces as you progress through the depths of the Dungeon. <strong>Please answer openly and honestly.</strong> Your answers will not be used against you. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023520?t=1758836972","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023520?t=1758836972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023520/72057c6b000984537259d08de2af9eb8056d35cb